be less numerous / subtle. Currently four arcs, some appear as dark lines, especially one extends beyond. Fine clipped.\n\nCat head: two eyes curves may appear closed. Good.\n\nTable: add thin wood grain lines perhaps:\n- On tabletop front face, two faint horizontal wavy paths #9E6D4F opacity .25. Already one line. Could add ","truncated":true}
